OL,3,GNEWSA'I felt violated that my sister's
OL,4,Amedical records were accessed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FAngelina Sabatino says that when her
OL,7,Fsister Gemma Sabatino was seriously ill
OL,8,Fin hospital all she wanted to do was
OL,9,Fprotect her.
OL,11,FIn November 2023, Gemma was
OL,12,Fexperiencing a mental health crisis
OL,13,Fthat left her in the neurosciences and
OL,14,Ftrauma critical care unit at
OL,15,FAddenbrooke's Hospital in Cambridge for
OL,16,Fmonths.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,374,370,200,160,0,100
