OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-, *,$%**,%-,* %%**,! ,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSA'I felt violated that my sister's
OL,4,Amedical records were accessed'
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe family did not allow visitors but
OL,7,Fwhen they discovered her medical notes
OL,8,Fand photos had been accessed by people
OL,9,Fwho had no clinical connection to her,
OL,10,FGemma and her sister were left
OL,11,Fdisgusted and angry.
OL,13,F"Gemma felt violated, I felt violated
OL,14,Ffor her," Angelina says.
